# D-93 (REVIEW ba92461, fable_pc's probe) with A3: a capturing helper of two formals, called by its host over its
# own occurrence with its two actuals and its capture n as a hidden input -- three inputs.  h2(1, 2) with n 5 = 8
# = q; add(1) = 9.  Entry 7.
fn: makeAdder (int: n) fn: (int: x) int
    fn: h2 (int: y; int: z) int
        return: n + y + z
    int: q (h2: 1 2)
    fn: addN (int: x) int
        return: q + x
    return: addN

add: makeAdder 5
int: a (add: 1)
int: ok 0
if: a = 9
    ok: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
